# chat-vault's request to keep a password decided from its card: the card goes in its turn (fading to 90%, its room
# closing on the rows' spring a little late), 未存入「测试服务登录」 fading in in its place (sfpages decision.mbt
# vault_ask_card).
timeout 20000
until =不存
wait 800
tap =不存
until 未存入「测试服务登录」
wait 1200
